<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>강재우 | 이력서</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="resume_style.css">
</head>
<body>
  <div class="wrapper">
    <header class="profile">
      <div class="profile-photo">사진</div>
      <div class="profile-info">
        <h1>강재우</h1>
        <p class="job">AI 헬스케어 개발자 지망</p>
        <ul class="contact">
          <li>📧 jaewoojaewoo777@gmail.com</li>
          <li>📞 010-1234-5678</li>
          <li>🔗 github.com/jaewoojaewoo777-rgb</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </header>

    <main>
      <section class="card">
        <h2>자기소개</h2>
        <p>
          광고대행사에서 7년간 일하며 사람들의 니즈를 읽고 결과로 증명하는 법을 배웠습니다.
          지금은 AI와 헬스케어를 접목한 서비스를 만들기 위해 코딩을 배우고 있습니다.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="card">
        <h2>경력</h2>
        <article class="item">
          <div class="item-head">
            <h3>광고대행사</h3>
            <span class="period">2017 ~ 2024</span>
          </div>
          <ul>
            <li>온라인 광고 기획 및 운영</li>
            <li>(담당했던 업무/성과를 구체적으로 작성)</li>
          </ul>
        </article>
      </section>

      <section class="card">
        <h2>교육</h2>
        <article class="item">
          <div class="item-head">
            <h3>OZ코딩스쿨 AI 헬스케어 7기</h3>
            <span class="period">수강 중</span>
          </div>
          <ul>
            <li>HTML / CSS 기초, Git·GitHub</li>
            <li>팀 미니프로젝트 팀장 (팀 도깨비군감투)</li>
          </ul>
        </article>
      </section>

      <section class="card">
        <h2>기술 스택</h2>
        <ul class="skills">
          <li>HTML</li>
          <li>CSS</li>
          <li>Python</li>
          <li>Git / GitHub</li>
        </ul>
      </section>
    </main>

    <footer>
      <p>&copy; 2026 강재우. All rights reserved.</p>
    </footer>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
/* ===== 공통 초기화 ===== */
* {
  margin: 0;
  padding: 0;
  box-sizing: border-box; /* padding, border를 width에 포함 */
}

body {
  font-family: "Pretendard", "Noto Sans KR", sans-serif;
  background-color: #f1f3f6;
  color: #333;
  line-height: 1.6;
}

ul {
  list-style: none;
}

/* ===== 레이아웃 ===== */
.wrapper {
  max-width: 800px;
  margin: 40px auto;
  padding: 0 16px;
}

/* ===== 프로필(header) : flex로 사진/정보 나란히 ===== */
.profile {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 28px;
  padding: 32px;
  background-color: #2f4858;
  color: #fff;
  border-radius: 12px;
  margin-bottom: 20px;
}

.profile-photo {
  width: 130px;
  height: 160px;
  flex-shrink: 0;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  background-color: #4a6a7d;
  border: 3px solid #fff;
  border-radius: 8px;
  font-size: 14px;
}

.profile-info h1 {
  font-size: 32px;
  font-weight: 700;
}

.job {
  font-size: 16px;
  color: #cfe3ee;
  margin-bottom: 12px;
}

.contact li {
  font-size: 14px;
  margin-bottom: 4px;
}

/* ===== 카드(section) ===== */
.card {
  background-color: #fff;
  padding: 24px 28px;
  margin-bottom: 20px;
  border: 1px solid #e0e4ea;
  border-radius: 12px;
}

.card h2 {
  font-size: 20px;
  color: #2f4858;
  padding-bottom: 8px;
  margin-bottom: 16px;
  border-bottom: 2px solid #2f4858;
}

.card p {
  font-size: 15px;
}

/* ===== 경력/교육 항목 ===== */
.item-head {
  display: flex;
  justify-content: space-between;
  align-items: baseline;
  margin-bottom: 8px;
}

.item-head h3 {
  font-size: 17px;
  font-weight: 600;
}

.period {
  font-size: 13px;
  color: #888;
}

.item ul li {
  font-size: 14px;
  padding-left: 14px;
  position: relative;
}

.item ul li::before {
  content: "•";
  position: absolute;
  left: 0;
}

/* ===== 기술 스택 ===== */
.skills {
  display: flex;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  gap: 10px;
}

.skills li {
  padding: 6px 16px;
  background-color: #e6eff5;
  color: #2f4858;
  border-radius: 20px;
  font-size: 14px;
  font-weight: 600;
}

/* ===== footer ===== */
footer {
  text-align: center;
  font-size: 13px;
  color: #888;
  padding: 16px 0;
}

/* ===== 반응형 : 화면 600px 이하 ===== */
@media (max-width: 600px) {
  .wrapper {
    margin: 16px auto;
  }

  .profile {
    flex-direction: column;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .item-head {
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 2px;
  }

  .skills {
    justify-content: center;
  }
}


